msgid ""
"The template needs information about you. It looks like you did not set that "
"information in the addressbook. Please set the information to use this "
"template"
msgstr "De Vörlaag bruukt Informatschonen över Di. As't lett hest Du disse Informatschonen nich in't Adressbook angeven. Giff de Informatschonen bitte an, wenn Du disse Vörlaag bruken wullt."

